WEBVTT

00:00:00.372 --> 00:00:08.692
The Operations calendar lays out every store’s day, hour by hour. In this video, you’ll read today’s work, switch views, and add a task.

00:00:09.716 --> 00:00:17.695
Open Operations. The calendar shows each task at its time, with the person on it. Here’s today, with a column for each café.

00:00:18.717 --> 00:00:24.221
Overdue tasks are flagged, finished ones get a tick, and every ticket type keeps its own color.

00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:30.690
Choose View by Team member to get a column per person instead, or switch to the week or the month.

00:00:31.824 --> 00:00:39.568
To add a task, click New task, or an empty slot. Pick the location, the ticket type, and the time, and it lands on the calendar.

00:00:40.592 --> 00:00:44.859
Click any task to mark it done, move it to another time, or open the ticket.
